---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Dashboard Features Gallery" currentPath="/docs/guides/features-gallery">
  <div class="space-y-8 font-mono text-xs">
    <div>
      <div class="text-[11px] text-purple-400 font-semibold mb-1">DASHBOARD TOUR</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-sans">Dashboard Features Gallery</h1>
      <p class="text-[#8f96a3] text-sm font-sans mt-1">Complete overview of all 8 sidebar categories and 55+ views.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#121622] border border-[#222738]">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase mb-1">1. Home & Radial Topology (Screenshot 586)</h2>
        <p class="text-[#8f96a3]">Central glowing RouteNex hub radiating smooth Bezier curves to outer connected providers with live RECENT REQUESTS token counters.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#121622] border border-[#222738]">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase mb-1">2. Endpoints & Tunnels (Screenshot 588)</h2>
        <p class="text-[#8f96a3]">Protocols for APIs, MCP, A2A, LAN IP copy, and tunnels for Cloud, Cloudflare, and Tailscale.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#121622] border border-[#222738]">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase mb-1">3. Providers Hub & Embedded Services (Screenshots 590 & 591)</h2>
        <p class="text-[#8f96a3]">347 providers with 12 category filter pills, 6 media pills, and CLIProxyAPI, 9Router, Mux, Bifrost, and Dario helper daemons.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#121622] border border-[#222738]">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase mb-1">4. 12-Engine Compression & Caveman (Screenshot 594)</h2>
        <p class="text-[#8f96a3]">10 toggleable Caveman language packs, Auto-Clarity Bypass, and token studio preview.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
